{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "kad6go1gmzq0li68", "title": "125.Dify搭建个人在线旅游助手", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"%E6%9C%AC%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%A0%E5%B0%86%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9\" id=\"%E6%9C%AC%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%A0%E5%B0%86%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2be252e\" id=\"ua2be252e\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">课程内容</span></h3><ol list=\"u961035c2\"><li fid=\"u139abc1a\" data-lake-id=\"ucf82489e\" id=\"ucf82489e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3b7367d\" id=\"uf3b7367d\">使用 Dify 构建 Agent 的方法</span></li><li fid=\"u139abc1a\" data-lake-id=\"u9c940697\" id=\"u9c940697\"><span data-lake-id=\"u567b33ce\" id=\"u567b33ce\">结构化的提示词撰写技巧</span></li><li fid=\"u139abc1a\" data-lake-id=\"ue333a142\" id=\"ue333a142\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90afdd54\" id=\"u90afdd54\">变量的使用方法</span></li></ol><h3 data-lake-id=\"1-%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87\" id=\"1-%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95893143\" id=\"u95893143\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">1. 准备</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua900402f\" id=\"ua900402f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3050c3c1\" id=\"u3050c3c1\">在新建 Agent 之前，请先确保以下步骤已经完成：</span></p><ul list=\"u71aaf2bd\"><li fid=\"uaf4ecea9\" data-lake-id=\"u4e794a5f\" id=\"u4e794a5f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf65aa043\" id=\"uf65aa043\">注册和登录</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud072cecb\" id=\"ud072cecb\"> </span><a href=\"https://dify.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua0a37ef3\" id=\"ua0a37ef3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u297c88c3\" id=\"u297c88c3\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Dify</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6aad379b\" id=\"u6aad379b\">，如果你想要进行本地部署，可以参考</span><span data-lake-id=\"u91cfed80\" id=\"u91cfed80\"> </span><a href=\"https://docs.dify.ai/zh-hans/getting-started/install-self-hosted/docker-compose\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u49ca54b8\" id=\"u49ca54b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u856ac7af\" id=\"u856ac7af\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">社区版 - Docker Compose 部署</span></a></li><li fid=\"uaf4ecea9\" data-lake-id=\"ub01ddc32\" id=\"ub01ddc32\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b5779cc\" id=\"u6b5779cc\">至少配置一个模型供应商（Dify 赠送 200 条 OpenAI 消息额度，但为了确保实验顺利建议自行配置 LLM 的 API Key）</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"2-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7\" id=\"2-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50c1a50c\" id=\"u50c1a50c\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">2. 配置工具</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"google\" id=\"google\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c098909\" id=\"u8c098909\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">Google</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u9426fe36\" id=\"u9426fe36\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91fa8747\" id=\"u91fa8747\">搭建在线旅游助手需要使用联网的搜索引擎作为参考资料来源，本文中将以 Google 作为示例。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufd17715d\" id=\"ufd17715d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u367fa974\" id=\"u367fa974\">当然，你也可以使用其他的搜索引擎，例如</span><a href=\"https://docs.dify.ai/zh-hans/guides/tools/tool-configuration/bing\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u65235ccc\" id=\"u65235ccc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaaa5a955\" id=\"uaaa5a955\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">必应</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u51d8b539\" id=\"u51d8b539\">，甚至是由 AI 驱动的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u56fe8183\" id=\"u56fe8183\"> </span><a href=\"https://docs.dify.ai/zh-hans/guides/tools/tool-configuration/perplexity\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue8cb4e04\" id=\"ue8cb4e04\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7b41c90\" id=\"ue7b41c90\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Perplexity</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uff9e4529\" id=\"uff9e4529\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u077da117\" id=\"u077da117\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc838ad0d\" id=\"uc838ad0d\">Dify 提供的 Google 工具基于 SerpAPI，因此需要提前进入 SerpAPI 的 API Key 管理页申请 API Key 并粘贴到</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud396ede7\" id=\"ud396ede7\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u03228eed\" id=\"u03228eed\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u49e74212\" id=\"u49e74212\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-code); background-color: rgb(var(--gray-100)/.5)\">Dify - 工具</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9a63e060\" id=\"u9a63e060\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u18a00cda\" id=\"u18a00cda\">的对应位置。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0311eebb\" id=\"u0311eebb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59ecf050\" id=\"u59ecf050\">具体操作步骤如下：</span></p><ol list=\"ue254bf51\"><li fid=\"ue3f9a82a\" data-lake-id=\"u04df9889\" id=\"u04df9889\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14db6288\" id=\"u14db6288\">新增 SerpAPI 的 API Key：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uce11a4a0\" id=\"uce11a4a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98e12a03\" id=\"u98e12a03\">进入</span><a href=\"https://serpapi.com/manage-api-key\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u02b03add\" id=\"u02b03add\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cce12c8\" id=\"u4cce12c8\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">SerpAPI - API Key</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ucce3aa8c\" id=\"ucce3aa8c\">，如果你尚未注册，会被跳转至进入注册页。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua021524f\" id=\"ua021524f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1773933\" id=\"ua1773933\">SerpAPI提供一个月100次的免费调用次数，这足够我们完成本次实验了。如果你需要更多的额度，可以增加余额，或者使用其他的开源方案。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf4cb5e90\" id=\"uf4cb5e90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96367da9\" id=\"u96367da9\">点击复制</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3a22f6c9\" id=\"u3a22f6c9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1747907399830-208eeb3c-e3b7-46b1-8638-16196f305911.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u36f632d6-4202-4f71-8fef-92219c5d3c9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucf394e97-5d2e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2246%2C%22originHeight%22%3A816%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ece1db%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufee1e5a9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><ol list=\"u623ecd7d\"><li fid=\"u8f77bc39\" data-lake-id=\"u6e1ce32c\" id=\"u6e1ce32c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1acb9196\" id=\"u1acb9196\">前往</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1e40dc89\" id=\"u1e40dc89\"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6b078016\" id=\"u6b078016\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--gray-900))\">Dify - 工具 - Google</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4a924bd5\" id=\"u4a924bd5\">：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u10822302\" id=\"u10822302\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufedc6ede\" id=\"ufedc6ede\">点击</span><span data-lake-id=\"u367bb027\" id=\"u367bb027\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub26a5c21\" id=\"ub26a5c21\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe31e361\" id=\"ufe31e361\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-code); background-color: rgb(var(--gray-100)/.5)\">去授权</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubdf9bd1a\" id=\"ubdf9bd1a\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1b4b195b\" id=\"u1b4b195b\">，填入API Key并保存。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4eacb6b5\" id=\"u4eacb6b5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1747907399744-dd43a206-71f9-499d-979f-77c4bcac9af1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0ec1df77-f8b9-4692-a9c8-518f2ba7ce2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucf394e97-5d2e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2864%2C%22originHeight%22%3A720%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%236db16e%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8dd12055%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"webscraper\" id=\"webscraper\"><span data-lake-id=\"u145bf5bc\" id=\"u145bf5bc\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">webscraper</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ucc63980a\" id=\"ucc63980a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u443cd91d\" id=\"u443cd91d\">本次实验中，我们需要一个爬虫工具从指定的网页中抓取内容，Dify 已提供内置工具，无需额外配置。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3f75af8d\" id=\"u3f75af8d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1747907399866-c64f2573-d3c6-4803-8f0a-c0d532732873.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8bbe8e49-99be-444e-930d-a494d716dbe%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucf394e97-5d2e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A828%2C%22originHeight%22%3A518%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0f2f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucf647c46%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"wikipedia\" id=\"wikipedia\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9bc16274\" id=\"u9bc16274\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">Wikipedia</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u91602676\" id=\"u91602676\"><span data-lake-id=\"u487cb6d4\" id=\"u487cb6d4\">我们还希望 Agent 能够准确介绍目的地知识，Wikipedia 是一个比较好知识来源，Dify 也内置了该工具，无需额外配置。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc065a44b\" id=\"uc065a44b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1747907399691-d2e41615-ae9c-4947-bec9-12c0670f807a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubca79c01-d6e3-4d40-a76a-df2d1855599%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucf394e97-5d2e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A828%2C%22originHeight%22%3A456%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eceef1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u51925892%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"3-%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA-agent\" id=\"3-%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA-agent\"><span data-lake-id=\"u593ce3ae\" id=\"u593ce3ae\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">3. 构建 Agent</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud37d7e09\" id=\"ud37d7e09\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84f05082\" id=\"u84f05082\">首先我们选择</span><span data-lake-id=\"uaa55c534\" id=\"uaa55c534\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9c1e555c\" id=\"u9c1e555c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub754f984\" id=\"ub754f984\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-code); background-color: rgb(var(--gray-100)/.5)\">创建空白应用 - Agent</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u99035447\" id=\"u99035447\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u48e1aabb\" id=\"u48e1aabb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10ea32d3\" id=\"u10ea32d3\">添加工具：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5b62f7b0\" id=\"u5b62f7b0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc93b9e70\" id=\"uc93b9e70\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-code); background-color: rgb(var(--gray-100)/.5)\">Google</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4bb581bf\" id=\"u4bb581bf\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc5d810b3\" id=\"uc5d810b3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05622565\" id=\"u05622565\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-code); background-color: rgb(var(--gray-100)/.5)\">webscraper</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4642fc36\" id=\"u4642fc36\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1aa2b027\" id=\"u1aa2b027\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc1d1cc59\" id=\"uc1d1cc59\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-code); background-color: rgb(var(--gray-100)/.5)\">wikipedia</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0961ae13\" id=\"u0961ae13\">并启用。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u177254bd\" id=\"u177254bd\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1747907399864-437bcf4b-bc8e-46a5-9a7e-dcbc0f8cdc4e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u519d9d9f-8736-4fd4-bf0d-0a4b8c0b4e5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucf394e97-5d2e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1150%2C%22originHeight%22%3A470%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2391b461%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubdcc952f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><ol list=\"u1f2badf6\"><li fid=\"ud459bdf0\" data-lake-id=\"u090d75fe\" id=\"u090d75fe\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9fc92cb9\" id=\"u9fc92cb9\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--gray-900))\">示例输出</span></strong></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u888981f7\" id=\"u888981f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86f0fdd1\" id=\"u86f0fdd1\">示例输出不是必要的部分。示例输出的目的是为了给 Agent 一个书写格式的参考，以确保 Agent 的输出更接近我们的期望。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9bbad839\" id=\"u9bbad839\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2b23481\" id=\"uf2b23481\">以下是旅游助手的示例输出：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%23%20%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%92%5Cn%5Cn**%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90**%5Cn1.%20%E8%82%AF%E8%BE%9B%E9%A1%BF%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%20(%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%9Awww.doylecollection.com%2Fhotels%2Fthe-kensington-hotel)%5Cn-%20%E8%AF%84%E5%88%86%EF%BC%9A4.6%E2%AD%90%5Cn-%20%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%9A%E6%AF%8F%E6%99%9A%E7%BA%A6350%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%5Cn-%20%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B%EF%BC%9A%E5%9D%90%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%A7%E6%91%84%E6%94%BF%E6%97%B6%E6%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%81%94%E6%8E%92%E5%88%AB%E5%A2%85%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E5%AE%B6%E4%BC%98%E9%9B%85%E7%9A%84%E9%85%92%E5%BA%97%E8%B7%9D%E7%A6%BB%E5%8D%97%E8%82%AF%E8%BE%9B%E9%A1%BF%E5%9C%B0%E9%93%81%E7%AB%995%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E6%AD%A5%E8%A1%8C%E8%B